---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import settings from '../../data/site-settings.json';
---
<Layout title_cy="Grantiau a Rhoddion" title_en="Grants &amp; Donations">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Grantiau a Rhoddion</span><span lang="en">Grants &amp; Donations</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo; <a href="/the-council/"><span lang="cy">Y Cyngor</span><span lang="en">The Council</span></a> &rsaquo; <span lang="cy">Grantiau</span><span lang="en">Grants</span></div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content">
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Grantiau a Rhoddion</span><span lang="en">Grants &amp; Donations</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn ystyried ceisiadau am grantiau a rhoddion gan grwpiau a sefydliadau lleol sy'n gwasanaethu cymunedau Llansannan, Bylchau, Groes a Bryn Rhyd-yr-Arian.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan Community Council considers applications for grants and donations from local groups and organisations serving the communities of Llansannan, Bylchau, Groes and Bryn Rhyd-yr-Arian.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Pwy all wneud cais?</span><span lang="en">Who can apply?</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Gall grwpiau cymunedol, elusennau cofrestredig a sefydliadau nid-er-elw sy'n gweithredu yn ardal y cyngor wneud cais.</p>
    <p lang="en">Community groups, registered charities and not-for-profit organisations operating in the council's area may apply.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Sut i wneud cais</span><span lang="en">How to apply</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">I wneud cais am grant, anfonwch lythyr at y Clerc yn nodi: enw'r grŵp, cyfanswm y cais, diben y cyllid, a sut y bydd yn elwa'r gymuned.</p>
    <p lang="en">To apply for a grant, write to the Clerk stating: the group's name, the amount requested, the purpose of the funding, and how it will benefit the community.</p>

    <p>
      <a href={`mailto:${settings.council.clerk_email_cy}?subject=Cais%20am%20grant`} class="btn" lang="cy">E-bostio'r Clerc →</a>
      <a href={`mailto:${settings.council.clerk_email}?subject=Grant%20application`} class="btn" lang="en">Email the Clerk →</a>
    </p>
    <p lang="cy">Neu defnyddiwch y <a href="/contact/">ffurflen gyswllt</a> i anfon eich cais. Os oes angen i chi atodi dogfennau (er enghraifft cyfrifon neu ddyfynbrisiau), e-bostiwch y Clerc yn uniongyrchol.</p>
    <p lang="en">Or use the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> to send your application. If you need to attach documents (such as accounts or quotes), email the Clerk directly.</p>

    <div class="notice" style="margin-top:2rem">
      <span lang="cy">Trafodir ceisiadau yng nghyfarfodydd rheolaidd y cyngor. Gall penderfyniadau gymryd hyd at ddau fis.</span>
      <span lang="en">Applications are discussed at the council's regular meetings. Decisions may take up to two months.</span>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
